---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | MathsIsCool" description="Privacy policy for MathsIsCool.com. We collect minimal data and never share personal information." currentPage="">
<div class="page">
  <div class="page-hero"><h1>Privacy <span style="color:var(--owl-brown)">Policy</span></h1><p>Last updated: 2025 — We keep it simple and honest.</p></div>
  <div class="seo-content">
    <h2>Our Commitment</h2>
    <p>MathsIsCool is committed to protecting your privacy. We collect as little data as possible.</p>
    <h3>Data We Collect</h3>
    <p><strong>Analytics:</strong> We use Google Analytics for aggregate traffic data — page views, country, device type. All anonymized. <strong>Advertising:</strong> Google AdSense may use cookies to show relevant ads. You can opt out at adssettings.google.com.</p>
    <h3>Cookies</h3>
    <p>We set one cookie for dark/light mode preference. Google Analytics and AdSense set their own cookies.</p>
    <h3>Children's Privacy</h3>
    <p>MathsIsCool welcomes students of all ages. We do not collect personal information from any user. No account or signup is ever required.</p>
    <h3>Contact</h3>
    <p>Questions? Use our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</div>
</Layout>
